Office PC par ngrok band karna

Jis window mein ngrok chal raha hai, us mein Ctrl + C dabayein, phir window band kar dein. Isi tarah npm start wali window mein bhi Ctrl + C.

Agar ngrok ki koi window nazar na aaye (kyunki Claude Code ne background mein chalaya tha), to PowerShell mein:

taskkill /IM ngrok.exe /F

"SUCCESS" aaye to band ho gaya.

Laptop par ngrok lagana

1. Download: browser mein ngrok.com/download kholein, Windows chunein aur zip download karein. Sirf official site se.

2. Jagah: D:\tools\ngrok naam ka folder banayein aur zip ke andar wali ngrok.exe wahan nikaal dein. Isay D:\final-expense-app ya D:\final-expense-data ke andar na rakhein. Agar Windows "unknown app" jaisi warning de, to "More info → Run anyway", kyunki ye official file hai.

3. Token (ek dafa), PowerShell mein:

& "D:\tools\ngrok\ngrok.exe" config add-authtoken APNA-TOKEN

4. Chalana: pehle ek window mein app:

cd D:\final-expense-app
npm start

Phir doosri window mein ngrok:

& "D:\tools\ngrok\ngrok.exe" http 5181 --url=lumpiness-alienate-coveting.ngrok-free.dev

Screen par "Session Status: online" aana chahiye. Ye window khuli rehni chahiye.

5. Check (teesri window mein):

Invoke-WebRequest "https://lumpiness-alienate-coveting.ngrok-free.dev/api/retell/webhook" -Headers @{ "ngrok-skip-browser-warning" = "1" } -UseBasicParsing | Select-Object StatusCode, Content

200 aana chahiye. Phir Retell mein webhook Test dabayein.

Path set karna zaroori nahi. Upar ke commands mein poora raasta (D:\tools\ngrok\ngrok.exe) likha hai, to wo kahin se bhi chal jayenge.
